  "development_scheme": "No fit. For each of the twelve months the shipped recipe is rebuilt from the cross-fitted v9 frame (scratch/v24), the v23 residual columns (runs/adsb_v25/dev/predictions_*.parquet, members adj2 and cat, row-wise mean) and the declared committee and LIRF development tables, with the weight on the touched scope set to each candidate's value. Reading 1: RMSE on the touched scope, per month and pooled by rows over all twelve months. Reading 2: RMSE on ALL rows of each month, which guards the rest of the recipe. The control candidate reproduces the incumbent and its predictions are the baseline for every comparison.",
