    "smoke_test": "DISCLOSURE. This declaration's candidates (0.25 control, 0.40, 0.50, 0.60, 0.75, 1.00), readings and selection rule were written in tools/declare_adsb_v28.py BEFORE any candidate was scored. The scoring tool performs no fit, so the code-path test of tools/run_adsb_v28.py necessarily produced real development numbers, and two months were seen before this file was written: on 2025-07 (864 rows of the touched scope) the scope RMSE was w25 445.755, w40 444.288, w50 443.724, w60 443.493, w75 443.771, w100 445.896; on 2025-11 (3,871 rows) it was w25 283.138, w40 283.957, w50 284.703, w60 285.608, w75 287.261, w100 290.785. The two months disagree. The control reproduced the incumbent's recorded all-rows RMSE exactly on both (267.5351881803 against 267.5351881802738, and 189.3526300873 against 189.35263008727185), which was the purpose of the test. No candidate, weight, reading, threshold or rule was added, removed or altered after those numbers were seen, and the scratch outputs were deleted. The remaining ten months, the pooled scope figure and every paired-day interval were unseen at declaration time."
