  "prediction_postprocess": "adsb-v28-v1",
  "prior_evidence": {
    "closed": "residual model tuning (v25 shipped, v26 and v27 null), the committee, calibration, test-time adaptation, the context scope over unmatched rows (v12), and the matcher fixes (docs/adsb_coverage/README.md); none is re-tested here.",
    "coverage": "docs/adsb_coverage/README.md: LIRF is 0.0% gate / 0.2% dark in the July 2026 ranking month; the touched scope holds 11,254 / 10,640 / 12,482 / 13,952 rows in January-April 2025 and 864-8,350 in the rest, 75,602 in total.",
    "no_candidate_scored": "no weight other than 0.25 and 0.50 has been scored on any month, and neither on this scope alone",
    "v24_round": "runs/adsb_v24/dev/selection.json: v7x_r12x_lirf25 mean ratio 0.994652 (Jan -0.4451%, Jul -0.3038%, Nov -1.1373%, Dec -0.2530%) against v7x_r12x_lirf50 mean ratio 0.994657 (Jan -0.4467%, Jul -0.3095%, Nov -1.1081%, Dec -0.2729%); both were eligible and 0.25 was selected on the mean. January 2025, the month whose LIRF rows are all unmatched, preferred 0.50. This declaration discloses that those two numbers were read before it was written; no other weight has ever been scored on any month."
  },
  "purpose": "The blend weight on LIRF non-population rows WITHOUT an ADS-B match. The coverage census (docs/adsb_coverage/README.md) found that LIRF loses its surface coverage entirely in the July 2026 ranking month (403k ground points in January 2026 against 2.1k over seven days in July; 0.0% gate, 0.2% dark, 72.1% never seen on the ground), so essentially every LIRF non-population row of that month takes this branch, and LIRF is the highest-error airport in the submission. The weight in force, 0.25, was chosen in adsb_v24 against 0.50 by a mean ratio of 0.994652 to 0.994657 - a margin of five parts in a million on whole-month RMSE, when those months were mostly LIRF-matched. The twelve development months contain 75,602 rows of this scope (11,254 in January 2025, when LIRF had no ADS-B coverage at all), which is enough to decide the weight on the regime that actually matters. Nothing else in the recipe changes and no model is fitted.",
