  "selection": "A candidate is eligible when: no recipe month is worse on ALL rows (ratio <= 1.0); the pooled twelve-month RMSE on the touched scope is at least 0.5% below the control's; and the paired-day bootstrap 95% interval of the scope RMSE difference against the control lies below zero in at least 8 of the twelve months. Among eligible candidates choose the lowest pooled scope RMSE (ties by name); otherwise select nothing and keep v23. The bar is set on the touched scope rather than on whole-month RMSE because the scope is a small part of most development months and a large part of the July 2026 ranking month; the whole-row condition on the recipe months is what protects the rest of the recipe.",
  "ship": "If a candidate is selected: the shipped v23 export is rebuilt with the same v9, residual models (the shipped v23 files, hash-bound), committee and LIRF tables and only this weight changed, exported as vigorous-whistle_v24.parquet through the frozen submission contract, verified by an independent re-implementation, audited (tools/audit_export.py), and uploaded only with the user's approval. Rows outside the touched scope must equal the uploaded v23 after rounding.",
